 group. Membership is carried by `ServiceAssociation` rows, not by a field here.\",\"properties\":{\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the component is connected and online (`true`) or disconnected, offline, or down (`false`). Unavailable components are excluded during simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Components of the same type (e.g., `PowerLoad`) must have unique names, but components of different types (e.g., `PowerLoad` and `ACBus`) can have the same name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"requirement\":{\"description\":\"The value of required reserves. Units: MW.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MW\"},\"reserve_direction\":{\"description\":\"Whether the reserve is an upward, downward, or symmetric reserve product.\",\"enum\":[\"UP\",\"DOWN\",\"SYMMETRIC\"],\"title\":\"ReserveDirection\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"variable\":{\"description\":\"Operating reserve demand curve for the group, either static or time-series-backed. A group carrying a curve is elastic: its requirement is priced by the curve rather than enforced. Time series values are carried via `time_series_associations` in the sidecar, never inline. Omit when the group has no demand curve.\",\"properties\":{\"power_units\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/UnitSystem\",\"default\":\"NATURAL_UNITS\"},\"value_curve\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/ValueCurve\"},\"variable_cost_type\":{\"const\":\"COST\",\"default\":\"COST\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"vom_cost\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\",\"default\":{\"curve_type\":\"INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"function_data\":{\"constant_term\":0,\"function_type\":\"LINEAR\",\"proportional_term\":0}}}},\"required\":[\"value_curve\",\"power_units\",\"vom_cost\",\"variable_cost_type\"],\"title\":\"CostCurve\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"name\",\"available\",\"requirement\",\"reserve_direction\"],\"title\":\"GroupReserve\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"HybridSystem\":{\"\$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"description\":\"A hybrid system co-locating a thermal unit, electric load, storage, and/or renewable unit behind a single grid interconnection.\",\"properties\":{\"active_power\":{\"description\":\"Initial active power set point of the unit. For power flow, this is the steady state operating point of the system. For production cost modeling, this may or may not be used as the initial starting point for the solver, depending on the solver used. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the component is connected and online (`true`) or disconnected, offline, or down (`false`). Unavailable components are excluded during simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"base_power\":{\"description\":\"Base power of the unit for per unitization, which is commonly the same as `interconnection_rating`. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"bus\":{\"description\":\"ID of the bus that this component is connected to.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"dynamic_injector\":{\"description\":\"ID of the corresponding dynamic injection device, if any.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"electric_load\":{\"description\":\"ID of a load with supertype `ElectricLoad`, if any.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"input_active_power_limits\":{\"description\":\"Minimum and maximum stable input active power levels. Set to `null` if not applicable. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"properties\":{\"max\":{\"title\":\"Max\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"min\":{\"title\":\"Min\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"MinMax\",\"type\":\"object\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"interconnection_efficiency\":{\"description\":\"Efficiency [0, 1.0] at the grid interconnection to model losses `in` and `out` of the common DC-side conversion. Set to `null` if not applicable.\",\"properties\":{\"in\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"out\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"InOut\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"interconnection_impedance\":{\"description\":\"Impedance between the hybrid system and the grid interconnection. Per-unit on `base_power`. Units: pu.\",\"properties\":{\"imag\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"real\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"ComplexNumber\",\"type\":\"object\",\"x-quantity\":\"Reactance\",\"x-unit\":\"pu\"},\"interconnection_rating\":{\"description\":\"Maximum rating of the hybrid system's interconnection with the transmission network. Set to `null` if not applicable. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVA, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":[\"number\",\"null\"],\"x-quantity\":\"ApparentPower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVA\"}},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Components of the same type (e.g., `PowerLoad`) must have unique names, but components of different types (e.g., `PowerLoad` and `ACBus`) can have the same name.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"operation_cost\":{\"description\":\"`MarketBidCost` of operating the hybrid system.\",\"properties\":{\"ancillary_service_offers\":{\"description\":\"IDs of the ancillary service components that this market bid offers into.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"cost_type\":{\"const\":\"MARKET_BID\",\"default\":\"MARKET_BID\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"curve_style\":{\"default\":0,\"description\":\"Curve-clearing style for the bid: 0 = CURVE (ordinary divisible price-setting curve, default); 1 = FIXED (clears as one indivisible all-or-nothing package over its period); 2 = VARIABLE (divisible quantity, block-priced, cannot set the settlement-point price). Corresponds to ERCOT's DAM PriceCurve curveStyle field (CURVE/FIXED/VARIABLE). A non-zero value is mutually exclusive with incremental_slope/decremental_slope.\",\"enum\":[0,1,2],\"type\":\"integer\"},\"decremental_offer_curves\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/CostCurve\",\"description\":\"Buy offer curves data as a `CostCurve` of `PiecewiseIncrementalCurve`.\"},\"decremental_slope\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Linear-interpolation flag for the decremental offer curves; false (default) is the step interpretation. Mutually exclusive with block groups on the same curve.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"incremental_offer_curves\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/CostCurve\",\"description\":\"Sell offer curves data as a `CostCurve` of `PiecewiseIncrementalCurve`.\"},\"incremental_slope\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Linear-interpolation flag for the incremental offer curves; false (default) is the step interpretation. Mutually exclusive with block groups on the same curve.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"minimum_energy_offer\":{\"\$ref\":\"https://openapi.invalid/schema/root-1068b1dda553e6e25b3b.json#/components/schemas/InputOutputCurve\",\"default\":{\"curve_type\":\"INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"function_data\":{\"constant_term\":0,\"function_type\":\"LINEAR\",\"proportional_term\":0}},\"description\":\"Minimum-energy offer: cost to operate at minimum stable level, in \$/MWh at the curve's minimum power, stored as submitted. \$/h sources convert at parse (MEO = no-load cost / P_min). Legacy scalar promotion: a bare scalar value `s` fr