response, see `PowerLoad`.\",\"properties\":{\"active_power\":{\"description\":\"Initial steady state active power demand. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the component is connected and online (`true`) or disconnected, offline, or down (`false`). Unavailable components are excluded during simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"base_power\":{\"description\":\"Base power of the unit for per unitization. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"bus\":{\"description\":\"ID of the bus that this component is connected to.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"conformity\":{\"default\":\"UNDEFINED\",\"description\":\"Indicates whether the specified load is conforming or non-conforming.\",\"enum\":[\"NON_CONFORMING\",\"CONFORMING\",\"UNDEFINED\"],\"title\":\"LoadConformity\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"dynamic_injector\":{\"description\":\"ID of the corresponding dynamic injection device, if any.\",\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"]},\"id\":{\"description\":\"Unique integer identifier for this component.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_active_power\":{\"description\":\"Maximum active power that this load can demand. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"max_reactive_power\":{\"description\":\"Maximum reactive power that this load can demand. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MVAr, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-quantity\":\"ReactivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MVAr\"}},\"name\":{\"description\":\"Name of the component. Components of the same type (e.g., 