"title\":\"Min\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"MinMax\",\"type\":\"object\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"active_power_limits_to\":{\"description\":\"Minimum and maximum active power flows to the TO node. Units: per power_units — NATURAL_UNITS: MW, COMPONENT_BASE: pu .\",\"properties\":{\"max\":{\"title\":\"Max\",\"type\":\"number\"},\"min\":{\"title\":\"Min\",\"type\":\"number\"}},\"title\":\"MinMax\",\"type\":\"object\",\"x-quantity\":\"ActivePower\",\"x-unit-discriminator\":\"power_units\",\"x-units\":{\"COMPONENT_BASE\":\"pu\",\"NATURAL_UNITS\":\"MW\"}},\"admittance_units\":{\"default\":\"NATURAL_UNITS\",\"description\":\"Unit basis for the series conductance g.\",\"enum\":[\"NATURAL_UNITS\",\"COMPONENT_MVAR\",\"COMPONENT_BASE\"],\"title\":\"AdmittanceUnitBasis\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"arc\":{\"description\":\"An Arc defining this line `from` a bus `to` another bus.\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"available\":{\"description\":\"Indicator of whether the component is connected and online (`true`) or disconnected, offline, or down (`false`). Unavailable components are excluded during simulations.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"base_power\":{\"description\":\"System base power for per-unitization of this component's per-unit fields, recorded per component in lieu of a system-level table. Units: MVA.\",\"type\":\"number\",\"x-unit\":\"MVA\"},\"converter_loss_from\":{\"default\":{\"curve_type\":\"INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"function_data\":{\"constant_term\":0,\"function_type\":\"LINEAR\",\"proportional_term\":0}},\"description\":\"Loss model coefficients in the `from` bus converter. It accepts a linear model or quadratic. Same converter data is used in both ends.\",\"properties\":{\"curve_type\":{\"const\":\"INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"default\":\"INPUT_OUTPUT\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"function_data\":{\"discriminator\":{\"mapping\":{\"LINEAR\":\"#/components/schemas/LinearFunctionData\",